## 1. Facts 
Record at least 5 things that we know from the scenario. 
1. The college is considering a college equipment booking system.
2. This will be for shared equipment such as laptops, camera, projectors and specialist equipment.
3. Bookings are currently being managed using a mixture of email, spreadsheets and informal arrangements.
4. Currently the equipment can be double-booked.
5. People are sometimes unsure whether equipment is available.
6. Staff must spend time checking the bookings manually.
7. The equipment may not be returned when it is expected.
8. Students are not always sure on who they need to contact about booking the equipment.

